When You Play The Slendy Monkeys Campaign, It Only Collects Hardware Software Occasionally, Aswell As Your City And Country.
Age Restrictions for the Slendy Monkeys Cammpaign - 
The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Is Based Of A Game That Is Meant For 13+ Users Due To The Possibly Disturbing Imagery. If Given Parental Permission A Child Under The Age Of 13 Could Play The Slendy Monkeys Campaign
With User Discretion.
The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Is Available For The Quest 2, Quest 3, Quest Pro, And Quest 3s.
Personal Data Collection - 
Due To The Service The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Uses For Banning, Reporting, And Stuff Like It Admins and Mods Can See Your City, Country, Your Ingame Username, And When You Logged On.
Usage Of Data - 
Hardware Software May Be Used To Determine If The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Is Playable On The User's Headset.
Data Is Not Collected, Or Deleted By The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Or Any Third Party Service. The Slendy Monkeys Campaign Stores Your City Location, And When You Logged On. Along With Your Username.
